Description: Add OpenAI-compatible image question and transformation tools
 Add two direct Tools menu actions and matching toolbar buttons for sending
 the current page to independently configured text and image endpoints.
 Keep generated images as reversible, session-only page overrides.
Author: Jannik Winkel <jannik.winkel@kiney.de>
Forwarded: no
